# Keep the build context small and clean — the build stage reinstalls and rebuilds from source.
# Adapted from Rackbops/artifact-console's own .dockerignore (design.md section 3/8); trimmed
# its deploy/answers.env* (Kenzen has no answers-file render step yet).
**/node_modules
.git
.github
docs
**/dist
# K4-7: packages/server/public/ is now genuinely generated (packages/web -> vite build), same
# reason AC excludes its own packages/host/public -- a stale local build must never leak into
# the image instead of a fresh one from this same build stage.
packages/server/public
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.claude
# Operator secrets never enter the image context.
deploy/.env*
